{"v":4,"catch":"打敗垃圾食物，拯救牙仙！","desc":"在關卡中跳躍、躲避並抓住每顆牙齒，釋放強力閃電，拯救被擄走的小仙子！\n\n在這款受許多經典街機遊戲啟發的快節奏平台遊戲中，加入勇敢仙子 Hanoka 的行列，從惡作劇的垃圾食物怪物魔掌中拯救被綁架的牙仙。\n\n遊戲特色\n- 真正的街機感，有 36 個關卡和 6 個老闆。\n- 甜美但致命的敵人\n- 可愛的像素藝術與嗶嗶作響的 chiptune 音樂\n- 豐富的額外功能！藝術畫廊、音樂播放器、獸誌，甚至還有遊戲的原型。\n\n10 位牙醫之中有 9 位推薦此遊戲！","publisher":"RAWRLAB Games","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["街機","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6bce077f205d37cf68bd46fb22d6fc7f43d487bfba2c102399bdf83361ee7bfc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7c91cdd943bf81b5b8eac7936f55adc9ff3814cc04d9e52cf99abd3a890b98f4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/013d4601e7d57ed81515973225ba9b8b42c4b35bcd5dc595bb5102b5c6a318a4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4dd5ef0026cb13f6aa28977fda36f446095170ee2bfcd6e735adb57cda529ff8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e1156b5fe44173b910275752d1791285dc92934c7da63661b5a87b4be7055ab1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/652f5b16028ab45e04710bc219ded0345b000d586749c40d4bebffd1f29005ba.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c8f024630000","dlc":[]}